@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide methods
top to bottom direction
title Professor profile — implemented PostgreSQL model (shared-schema subset)
class User <<shared entity>> {
  +id: UUID {PK}
  +email: String {unique}
  +authSubject: String? {unique}
  +role: UserRole
}
class ProfessorProfile <<entity>> {
  +userId: UUID {PK, FK}
  +displayName: String {max 80}
  +degree: String {max 200}
  +department: String {max 120}
  +education: String {max 2000}
  +about: String {max 5000}
  +researchAreas: String[]
  +contactEmail: String?
  +virtualOfficeUrl: String? {HTTPS}
  +officeHours: String {max 500}
  +photoId: UUID? {FK}
  +version: Int {positive}
  +updatedAt: DateTime
}
class FileAsset <<shared entity>> {
  +id: UUID {PK}
  +ownerId: UUID {FK}
  +storageKey: String {unique, private}
  +originalName: String
  +mediaType: String
  +sizeBytes: Int
  +purpose: FilePurpose
  +createdAt: DateTime
}
class Opportunity <<shared entity; partial view>> {
  +id: UUID {PK}
  +professorId: UUID {FK}
  +title: String
  +description: String
  +duration: String?
  +hoursMin: Int?
  +hoursMax: Int?
  +deadline: DateTime?
  +status: OpportunityStatus
  +publishedAt: DateTime?
}
ProfessorProfile "0..1" --> "1" User : owner
FileAsset "0..*" --> "1" User : owner
ProfessorProfile "0..1" --> "0..1" FileAsset : photo (same owner)
Opportunity "0..*" --> "1" ProfessorProfile : professor
note as Scope
  Implemented profile UI uses owner-only API methods.
  Posted list filters status = PUBLISHED before limiting.
  Text and photo updates require the expected profile version.
  Photos: valid decoded PNG/JPEG/WebP, nonempty, <= 2 MiB.
  File bytes live in ignored .dev/uploads; metadata is in PostgreSQL.
  The sample-professor session is local development only.
  Full shared schema appears in shared-data-class.puml.
end note
@enduml
